# TypeORM Documentation for Models

- Always use Context7 MCP with library `/typeorm/typeorm` when operating on files in `backend/src/models`
- Use Context7 to query TypeORM documentation for:
  - Entity definitions and decorators
  - Relationships and associations
  - Column types and options
  - Indexes and constraints
  - Query builder patterns
  - Migration patterns
  - Best practices for model design
